  "lesson-roblox-4-4": {
    "lessonId": "lesson-roblox-4-4",
    "moduleId": "module-04",
    "order": 4,
    "title": "4.4 - Tables and Upgrades",
    "learningObjectives": [
      "Store upgrade data in Luau tables",
      "Drive pricing and production values from config",
      "Apply selected upgrade effects dynamically",
      "Avoid hard-coded tycoon logic duplication"
    ],
    "estimatedTime": 60,
    "theory": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Config-Driven Upgrades",
          "content": "Tables let you define upgrade tiers once and reuse data cleanly.\n\nExample benefits:\n- Easy balancing\n- Faster content updates\n- Less copy/paste logic"
        },
        {
          "title": "Build an Upgrade Table",
          "content": "Create ModuleScript or local table:\n\n```lua\nlocal upgrades = {\n  { id = 1, price = 0, spawnRate = 2.0, value = 1 },\n  { id = 2, price = 100, spawnRate = 1.5, value = 2 },\n  { id = 3, price = 300, spawnRate = 1.0, value = 4 },\n}\n```\n\nEach tier controls both speed and reward."
        },
        {
          "title": "Apply Upgrade by Current Tier",
          "content": "When player buys upgrade:\n- Increase tier index\n- Read matching table entry\n- Update dropper settings\n\n```lua\nlocal current = upgrades[currentTier]\ndropperSpawnRate = current.spawnRate\ncoinValue = current.value\n```\n\nNow your machine behavior comes from data, not hard-coded branches."
        },
        {
          "title": "Balancing with Data",
          "content": "Try these balancing checks:\n- Can players reach tier 2 in under 2 minutes?\n- Is tier 3 meaningful but not impossible?\n- Does each tier feel noticeably stronger?\n\nAdjust only table values, then retest. This is real game economy workflow."
        }
      ]
    },
    "practiceTask": {
      "title": "Practice Build: Three-Tier Upgrade",
      "difficulty": "beginner",
      "description": "Implement a 3-tier dropper upgrade system using a table that changes both spawn speed and coin value.",
      "hints": [
        "Keep upgrade data in one place so future rebalance takes seconds.",
        "Show current tier in UI or print logs to confirm table values are applied."
      ],
      "optionalChallenge": "Add a fourth prestige tier with very high cost and a special visual effect around the dropper."
    }
  },
