          "content": "Store next required checkpoint index per player.\n\nPseudo flow:\n1. Player crosses CP1 -> next = CP2\n2. Player crosses CP2 -> next = CP3\n3. Player crosses CP3 -> next = Finish\n4. Crossing Finish increments lap"
